{"title":"동거인은 무릎, 때때로 머리 위","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=b53OmU/hAd4n0IA1S/4mKcx58lKuFCo3TPf1hvfk&filename=th3","synopsis":"인간과 고양이, 두 주인공이 그려가는 따스한 동거 드라마.\n\n삐딱하고 사람을 싫어하는 은둔형 미스터리 작가 미카츠키 스바루. \n어느 날, 길에서 5:5 가르마의 턱시도 고양이 ‘하루’를 냥줍하면서 \n갈팡질팡 시행착오로 가득한 동거생활을 시작하는데…. \n대인관계가 서툰 청년×오지랖 넓은 길냥이. \n둘의 시점에서 펼쳐지는 탈도 많지만 행복한 동거생활♥  \n\n※애니메이션 <동거인과 무릎, 때때로 머리 위> 절찬 방영 중!!\n\nⓒMinatsuki ⓒFutatsuya As/COMIC POLARIS","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":269,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":259,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":264,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-23","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":664476,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":664507,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":664544,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":664563,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":664581,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":664607,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":664628,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":664665,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":664699,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":664723,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":664764,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":664794,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":664813,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":664837,"rc":6489,"rs":64829,"cc":1183},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":664856,"rc":64